{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ghostly</strong> transforms your Windows experience with a sleek, expandable, and highly customizable widget. Control your music and media playback through an intuitive <strong>Dynamic Island</strong>, complete with track info and thumbnail preview for a smooth and modern experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502190/extras/41d01704947d12dfca0a3f16b888fc6b.poster.avif?t=1752952324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502190/extras/41d01704947d12dfca0a3f16b888fc6b.webm?t=1752952324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502190/extras/41d01704947d12dfca0a3f16b888fc6b.mp4?t=1752952324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Media Controls:</strong> Play, pause, and navigate your music or videos directly from the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Integrated Calendar:</strong> Quickly check the time and date, with support for 24-hour format.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Audio Visualizer:</strong> Enjoy an animated waveform visualizer that reacts to your audio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502190/extras/fc5e4f77aeedb104e952fc1fb74a6542.webp?t=1752952324\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502190/extras/fc5e4f77aeedb104e952fc1fb74a6542.poster.avif?t=1752952324\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between <strong>light and dark mode</strong> to match your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust the <strong>opacity</strong> and <strong>visual style</strong> of the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the <strong>app icon</strong> with your own images.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enable <strong>classic mode</strong> for an even simpler, minimal interface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502190/extras/bcdf4db1b08075133da0f3bc2814bcf9.webp?t=1752952324\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502190/extras/bcdf4db1b08075133da0f3bc2814bcf9.poster.avif?t=1752952324\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502190/extras/e970416ecda53de0fd6f7197751c8fab.poster.avif?t=1752952324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502190/extras/e970416ecda53de0fd6f7197751c8fab.webm?t=1752952324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502190/extras/e970416ecda53de0fd6f7197751c8fab.mp4?t=1752952324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >System Integration:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose which <strong>primary monitor</strong> displays the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enable <strong>auto-start</strong> with Windows to have Ghostly ready at boot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3502190?t=1752952324","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502190/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752952324","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502190/a5a69f27e83bbdc68e5cd7eb9167528848f80e3e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752952324","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502190/a5a69f27e83bbdc68e5cd7eb9167528848f80e3e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752952324","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ghostly</strong> transforms your Windows experience with a sleek, expandable, and highly customizable widget. Control your music and media playback through an intuitive <strong>Dynamic Island</strong>, complete with track info and thumbnail preview for a smooth and modern experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502190/extras/41d01704947d12dfca0a3f16b888fc6b.poster.avif?t=1752952324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502190/extras/41d01704947d12dfca0a3f16b888fc6b.webm?t=1752952324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502190/extras/41d01704947d12dfca0a3f16b888fc6b.mp4?t=1752952324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Media Controls:</strong> Play, pause, and navigate your music or videos directly from the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Integrated Calendar:</strong> Quickly check the time and date, with support for 24-hour format.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Audio Visualizer:</strong> Enjoy an animated waveform visualizer that reacts to your audio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:/